{
  "script_id": "surface-revolution",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "陶艺师做花瓶时，只需在旋转的陶轮上勾出侧面的轮廓，转一圈，整个瓶体就成型了。这正是旋转曲面的做法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48384,
      "text": "数学上，取一条平面曲线作母线，绕一根轴旋转一周，扫过的轨迹就是旋转曲面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "这个构造出奇地强大：球面、环面、悬链面、伪球面、双曲面、抛物面，全都能这样造出来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "unified",
      "line_id": "un-1",
      "filename": "unified-un-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/unified-un-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.24,
      "size": 51840,
      "text": "参数化极其简洁。母线写成径向距离 r 和高度 z 两个函数，都用母线参数 t 表示。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "unified",
      "line_id": "un-2",
      "filename": "unified-un-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/unified-un-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.83,
      "size": 61344,
      "text": "旋转时再引入绕轴的角度 u，横坐标就是 r 乘余弦 u，纵坐标是 r 乘正弦 u，竖直坐标直接就是 z。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "unified",
      "line_id": "un-3",
      "filename": "unified-un-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/unified-un-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "size": 52848,
      "text": "换句话说，整族旋转曲面只差一条母线。改母线就改曲面，参数化的骨架完全不动。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "ga-1",
      "filename": "gallery-ga-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/gallery-ga-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.65,
      "size": 58320,
      "text": "先看最熟悉的。母线取正弦和余弦，也就是半个圆，转出来是球面。它的高斯曲率处处为正。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "ga-2",
      "filename": "gallery-ga-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/gallery-ga-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.49,
      "size": 71856,
      "text": "母线取双曲余弦，转出悬链面，这是除平面外唯一的极小旋转面。母线取双曲正割，转出伪球面，高斯曲率处处为负。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "ga-3",
      "filename": "gallery-ga-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/gallery-ga-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "母线取一段圆但不通过轴，转出环面，中间就有了洞。母线随手画一条波浪线，转出的就是花瓶。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "pappus",
      "line_id": "pp-1",
      "filename": "pappus-pp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/pappus-pp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "旋转曲面的面积和体积有现成的公式，来自古希腊数学家帕普斯，后来古尔丁重新发现。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "pappus",
      "line_id": "pp-2",
      "filename": "pappus-pp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/pappus-pp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.61,
      "size": 73728,
      "text": "侧面积等于二倍圆周率乘以母线弧长积分，被积函数里带着径向距离。体积则是圆周率乘以径向距离平方对高度的积分。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "pappus",
      "line_id": "pp-3",
      "filename": "pappus-pp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/pappus-pp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.35,
      "size": 69552,
      "text": "屏幕上显示的就是数值积分的结果。单位球面得四倍圆周率，体积得三分之四倍圆周率，与教科书上的公式完全一致。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-1",
      "filename": "verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.01,
      "size": 64224,
      "text": "请依次切换几种母线，注意面积和体积读数的变化。环面的面积应该是四倍圆周率平方乘主半径乘管半径。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-2",
      "filename": "verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.08,
      "size": 65232,
      "text": "抛物面的体积也能手算核对：径向距离就是参数本身，高度是它的平方，积出来是圆周率乘参数四次方除以二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-3",
      "filename": "verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "这些数字都对得上，说明参数化和积分公式都没写错。这比单凭形状看着像可靠得多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48384,
      "text": "第一，旋转曲面由一条母线绕轴旋转而成，参数化只需径向距离与高度两个函数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.85,
      "size": 45648,
      "text": "第二，球面、环面、悬链面、伪球面、双曲面、抛物面全是它的特例。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "surface-revolution",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/surface-revolution/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.84,
      "size": 61488,
      "text": "第三，帕普斯定理给出面积与体积的积分公式，数值结果与理论值吻合。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
